{"unit_id":"hackerFish__dsh-voice-input#feature-1","repo":"hackerFish/dsh-voice-input","commit":"c5855427c77a5b5a7e8f2936349a3c70de5478df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Voice Input 的功能「语音转草稿」：使用浏览器语音识别中文口述，并将最终转写追加到当前对话草稿。点击输入条麦克风按钮开始识别，说完停顿或再次点击即可结束；结果可检查修改后再发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:148-154","src/client/index.ts:178-192","src/client/index.ts:231-234"]}
{"unit_id":"hackerFish__dsh-voice-input#feature-2","repo":"hackerFish/dsh-voice-input","commit":"c5855427c77a5b5a7e8f2936349a3c70de5478df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Voice Input 的功能「语音识别状态提示」：聆听时显示实时转写和状态指示，浏览器不支持识别、权限被拒、没有麦克风或识别网络出错时显示对应提示。用户通过输入条的麦克风按钮触发识别。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:185-210","src/client/index.ts:269-299"]}
{"unit_id":"hackerFish__dsh-voice-input#feature-3","repo":"hackerFish/dsh-voice-input","commit":"c5855427c77a5b5a7e8f2936349a3c70de5478df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Voice Input 的功能「设置状态页」：在设置插件标签页展示浏览器是否支持 Web Speech API，并请求本机健康路由显示 host 插件加载状态。用户从设置页查看引擎、简要用法与加载信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:302-339","src/host/index.ts:14-33"]}
{"unit_id":"hackerFish__dsh-voice-input#caveat-1","repo":"hackerFish/dsh-voice-input","commit":"c5855427c77a5b5a7e8f2936349a3c70de5478df","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Voice Input 使用浏览器 Web Speech API，识别依赖浏览器内置的在线语音服务；需要麦克风权限，网络不可用时会提示识别错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:168-182","src/client/index.ts:194-205"]}
